	)
	(text "Copied from the Radxa Rock 5B v1.45 schematic, sheet 29 (its one Type-C port).\nPort 2 sources 5 V: SY6280AAC switch as on the reference's USB host port (sheet 27), limit 6800 / 3.4K = 2 A.\nThe reference has no sourcing Type-C port, so this switch arrangement is new for this board.\nLeft out: the common-mode choke on the USB 2 pair, the zero-ohm links, and the input-voltage ADC divider.\nESD parts: TPD4E05U06 for the reference's ESD73034D, generic dual TVS for its ESD5302F: confirm equivalents.\nThe interrupt pull-up goes to 3.3 V to match the GPIO bank (the reference pulls it to 1.8 V).\nThe processor's OTG ID ball is unused: the port's role comes from the PD controller."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
